[{"title":"登小金山","author":"涂麟","text":"寻幽直上妙高台，云锁禅堂昼不开。\n古径有松栖老鹤，断碑无字翳苍苔。\n水拖秋色连天去，风捲潮声动地来。\n我亦九霄云外客，隔花啼鸟莫相催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8429,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日珠江宴集","author":"黄持衡","text":"雁翅城边小雨垂，高台面面海风吹。\n潮奔健马排金刹，云驾残虹吸玉池。\n鲛室鸣机劳素女，龙宫听法舞冯夷。\n酒阑僧定禅关暮，鼓柁洪涛纵所之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8430,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游小金山","author":"招于莘","text":"登台再拜东坡老，醉眼睁看北斗标。\n未信瘴乡生白发，独怜天下苦青苗。\n寒云岛外横孤鹤，明月船头忆洞箫。\n几度登临重怀古，清风吹送海边潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8431,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡山飞来寺","author":"招于莘","text":"十年一到飞来寺，百粤重开蓬岛天。\n石磴拂云羁坐客，虬松归鹤舞游仙。\n桃花洞口犬不吠，明月门前僧自眠。\n金锁玉环成往事，淡烟荒草祇年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8432,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡山飞来寺","author":"梁可夫","text":"独上飞来自一天，更于何地觅神仙。\n石台局面留棋迹，云洞环归带玉悬。\n入定禅僧寻定处，明心行者悟心泉。\n沙门法界轮回转，中有灵岩独峭然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8433,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望小金山","author":"林烈","text":"望望灵洲景，迢迢过石门。\n壮怀观上国，离思忆家园。\n鸟语前山树，人烟远岸村。\n扁舟追李郭，佳句落芳尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8434,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡山飞来寺","author":"林烈","text":"浪迹遨游类转蓬，又维孤舫翠微中。\n江流环绕鱼舠稳，石磴参差鸟道通。\n千里壮游霄汉近，万年全盛帝王风。\n清歌欲奏霓裳曲，桂影扶疏月出东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8435,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒李忠简公祠","author":"侯国治","text":"江上蕊珠宫，前修曾卜筑。\n重瞻祠像新，间气钟南服。\n鼎甲早致身，正言清辇谷。\n引裾去奸回，排难全郡牧。\n缒城散群凶，万家再造福。\n趋阙屡抗章，拂衣返嵓谷。\n心与秋鹤飞，节并凌霜竹。\n奕奕绍家声，振振蕃公族。\n遗庙敞云根，故国存乔木。\n环宇晓峰青，映阶烟水绿。\n千祀仰高风，流峙长清淑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8436,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过青阳望庐山","author":"翟中立","text":"青阳令尹南康守，到处为官有异才。\n庙食四时奠蘋藻，碑铭千古不莓苔。\n九华山顶虎巢塞，五老峰头鹿洞开。\n在在经过非偶尔，祖孙缘却自天来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8437,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺","author":"黎锦","text":"凌空梵刹定何年，风景分明别有天。\n素练潆回涵碧落，翠屏环合袅晴烟。\n碧桃冉冉春千树，瑶草霏霏屋数椽。\n指顾蓬莱天咫尺，更于何处觅神仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8438,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙桥渡","author":"郑一统","text":"金碧丛中芳未歇，天风淅淅东井冽。\n道人一醉紫霞归，双眼玲珑弄秋月。\n双眼玲珑弄秋月，渔声何处施罛濊。\n便将野渡作星槎，直泛银河访机织。\n一水盈盈异悲悦，我欲万丈驾云梁，无劳太史虚饶舌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8439,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题城东见山亭","author":"郑一统","text":"平郊迤逦面水城，古树蓊郁罗园亭。\n夕烟朝霞递起灭，锦画石屏纷隐明。\n玩芳凭栏眼自醉，挹秀扪苔他不营。\n何须别向觅方外，这里却是真蓬瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8440,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉堂对菊","author":"郑一统","text":"簇簇金丛向彩栏，二林偏喜壮奇观。\n新枝却带三秋露，晚节那惊九月寒。\n盈把任从陶令醉，落英何但楚人餐。\n托根还是清华地，毕竟芬芳到玉銮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8441,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京邸中秋玩月","author":"郑一统","text":"楚天爽气满神州，今夕人间半度秋。\n玉露几团初欲滴，冰轮一点向空流。\n浮烟扫去星河静，素影飞来几榻幽。\n共醉清华眠碧落，此身不觉在瀛洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8442,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题茂林","author":"郑一统","text":"洪波撼石响琳琅，细雨凄林色郁苍。\n林密有溪穿水洞，石平随意作鱼梁。\n桐江竟系炎光鼎，清渭全苏赪尾鲂。\n心迹未须论出处，一蓑风月想馀芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8443,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遇雨","author":"赵崇信","text":"戍角声悲已十年，客心闻战益凄然。\n小溪积雨倾湓下，不为蛮方洗瘴烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8444,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挹泉亭","author":"赵崇信","text":"旧游随处足堪誇，两度飞来兴转嘉。\n捣药老僧忘入定，吠泉仙犬祇眠花。\n洞岩几处风烟古，楼阁诸天薜荔斜。\n一水红尘填不满，千秋长泛利名槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8445,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游海珠寺","author":"赵崇信","text":"红槿黄莲开渡头，烟花不减到瀛洲。\n人间胜地风尘隔，石上长江岁月流。\n时事不关僧对语，潇湘无梦夜乘舟。\n蒹葭泛泛生寒溜，红日远天钟鼓浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8446,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"光孝寺访奇峰上人","author":"赵崇信","text":"静爱沙门老岁华，河阳归客住山家。\n听来钟罢僧还定，缥缈钟声隔紫霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8447,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘阴道中","author":"何彦","text":"迢迢南望又长沙，竟日驱车到海涯。\n云暝溪桥迷去马，雪寒枯木点啼鸦。\n村舂市店游人道，烟火疏篱野老家。\n几度观风独惆怅，咨诹今已愧皇华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8448,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日偕兵宪周狮峰同年谯湫宾山游 其一","author":"何彦","text":"淡淡秋容点葛衣，追游不负此佳期。\n云移石洞萝阴合，风静寒江树影微。\n掷甲山留终古恨，磨旗人忆往时悲。\n兴亡自是寻常事，漫向樽前索旧题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8449,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日偕兵宪周狮峰同年谯湫宾山游 其二","author":"何彦","text":"晚憩龙山此日行，荒台寂寂傍孤城。\n人归古岸寒烟断，鸟弄深溪夕照明。\n几度登临还胜会，一时宾佐有馀情。\n风流故态今何在，空记当年落帽名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8450,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岳宿上封寺","author":"何彦","text":"攀缘直上最高峰，五老山尊让祝融。\n南去香炉插天柱，东回紫盖拥芙蓉。\n入云鸡犬通仙界，出洞苍虬隐怪松。\n风送梵音人语静，炉烟袅袅傍疏钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8451,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三城秋望","author":"何彦","text":"三城引望思依依，秋入衡阳雁始归。\n共酌花边风物丽，忽闻江上鼓鼙希。\n苍茫树色连烟火，澹荡山光接翠微。\n但愿海波长自定，白头吟弄老渔矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8452,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登小金山","author":"苏应旻","text":"十年尘梦笑中过，此日相携上宝陀。\n莫讶山僧非佛印，也能倾倒醉东坡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8453,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"葛仙亭","author":"苏应旻","text":"层云森古寺，返照静渔矶。\n山色水传去，溪声松助之。\n听经孤鹤舞，采药一僧归。\n安得如来者，高谈慰所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8454,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初入朱明洞东方子王子","author":"冼桂奇","text":"野木千章合，朱明一洞深。\n廿年空梦寐，此日正登临。\n流水窗前绕，青山户外阴。\n兴来同二子，长啸入云岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8455,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初侍讲于青霞洞 其一","author":"冼桂奇","text":"野洞初开胜，风烟称一家。\n人争言白鹿，我道是青霞。\n怪石千重险，飞泉百道斜。\n千秋传盛事，分讲到天华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8456,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初侍讲于青霞洞 其二","author":"冼桂奇","text":"杳杳青霞洞，山门石自成。\n林深多野鹿，地僻断秋蝇。\n竹里闻樵唱，松根看道经。\n山人惯来往，险绝不须矜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8457,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初谒四贤祠","author":"冼桂奇","text":"白日悬孤庙，青山俨四贤。\n香蘋初采涧，异世本同天。\n神爽窗前月，风流洞口烟。\n山源久湮没，重此浥渊泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8458,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱明洞和韵","author":"冼桂奇","text":"飞云缥缈路如线，此日登临忆四贤。\n喜向青霞开后洞，谩从丹灶觅先天。\n即看石壁新题刻，还上江门旧钓船。\n同是罗浮寻胜客，独誇骢马最先鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8459,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞云顶","author":"冼桂奇","text":"振衣千仞上，渺渺御天风。\n道遇餐霞子，山回采药翁。\n石楼晴复雨，野径断还通。\n榻古荒苔没，庵残乱草封。\n秋云半岭白，海日五更红。\n恍惚闻仙乐，依稀驾彩虹。\n麻姑分竹叶，玉女献芙蓉。\n从此忘归路，优游四百峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8460,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访石泉虚馆有感","author":"冼桂奇","text":"草阁风烟旧，重游感慨深。\n石泉何寂寞，松竹自萧森。\n春入蟠龙老，门悬瀑布阴。\n隔林啼鸟乱，如喜故人临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8461,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汾溪","author":"冼桂奇","text":"清溪万里接河汾，洙泗源流一脉分。\n风罢舞雩归去晚，直从濂洛起斯文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8462,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹤园","author":"冼桂奇","text":"老鹤将雏起万松，碧桃初熟荔枝红。\n芳园景色流风远，独念当年友鹤翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8463,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古洛钓台","author":"冼桂奇","text":"古洛新成一钓台，石桥流水几人来。\n相逢莫问行藏事，且看沙鸥日往回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8464,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞云峰","author":"冼桂奇","text":"三春梦入铁桥西，缥缈飞云树欲齐。\n几处断碑苔藓合，半空残塔紫烟迷。\n丹崖碧涧宜真隐，玉树琼芝足品题。\n我欲凌虚游八极，月明山馆忽闻鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8465,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菩提坛待月","author":"何维柏","text":"清斋饭罢暮钟时，塔里传灯树影稀。\n僧在上方秋寂寂，月生东海夜迟迟。\n风幡著相心先动，明镜非台性自知。\n却笑黄梅留偈别，三更衣钵使人疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8466,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见塔","author":"何维柏","text":"西来衣钵肇南宗，预见浮屠立海东。\n光照菩提七宝里，窍生鄞鄂五明中。\n相轮有相原无相，空洞如空未必空。\n欲识本来真面目，须从元始契参同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8467,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游小金山 其一","author":"何维柏","text":"月白玄鸟归，山空松子落。\n知心千载人，神交付溟漠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8468,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游小金山 其二","author":"何维柏","text":"空空未必空，有事本无事。\n差失毫釐间，作用迥不似。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8469,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"何维柏","text":"虚亭面芳沼，好月散遥林。\n坐观群动息，时闻蟋蟀吟。\n气机无停晷，万化自升沉。\n晦冥迭昼夜，往来成古今。\n物理各自适，兹理会予心。\n虚明生夜景，清风洒吾襟。\n整衣起巡檐，迟迟步花阴。\n呼童泻青尊，对影自酌斟。\n爇香旋中庭，鸣我花间琴。\n缅怀千载下，希聆疏越音。\n高梧发孤籁，契予天机深。\n对此不能寐，待旦夙所歆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8470,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日看云","author":"何维柏","text":"晴空澹虚碧，寥廓净氛埃。\n倏忽弥轮合，珠光漫昭回。\n杳霭丹青迥，参差图画开。\n巃嵷屼层巘，缥缈叠楼台。\n花葩驻华盖，鸾鹤翥蓬莱。\n虞廷和歌远，王母香车回。\n舒捲苍梧野，荟蔚南山隈。\n翔凤衔五色，从龙泽九垓。\n氤氲腾郁郁，宇宙何恢恢。\n杖藜无不可，古往同今来。\n须臾纷变幻，蜉蝣万劫灰。\n太虚一片度，尧舜何有哉。\n睇此无心物，我姑酌金罍。\n閒情寄遥汉，行歌独徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8471,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登金山览旧游书怀","author":"何维柏","text":"南北中流迥，乾坤砥柱成。\n江襟彭蠡泽，山拱石头城。\n往迹千年在，归舟一剑横。\n狂澜不可禦，感叹几时平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8472,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下酌别赠陈洛南方伯入京","author":"何维柏","text":"逸思閒云外，清尊皓月中。\n回看十载别，老作一渔翁。\n梧影澹寒水，桂香浮远风。\n明年何处会，能记此宵同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8473,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"香山寺晚眺","author":"何维柏","text":"翠积香山迥，烟深草径迷。\n傍桥寻谷口，缘磴蹑招提。\n孤鸟连云远，平原入望低。\n回瞻双凤阙，高峙玉河西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8474,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度大庾岭","author":"何维柏","text":"梅关山色旧，蒲石未寒盟。\n古木堪垂钓，江门好濯缨。\n片云浮世界，孤月澹沧溟。\n八极神游远，悠悠得此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8475,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游白云山","author":"何维柏","text":"登林地迥三城尽，紫翠烟深一径微。\n云净九龙依洞出，台空孤鹤向人飞。\n千山佳气平临目，万壑凉飙故拂衣。\n怅望清秋情不极，皓歌回首月斜晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8476,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游西樵山","author":"何维柏","text":"采芳犹及暮春前，路入桃源洞里天。\n几片落花临钓石，数声鸣鸟破朝烟。\n回看世界真如幻，每到林泉似有缘。\n欲识舞雩童冠乐，且随花柳过前川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8477,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水澳横舟","author":"何维柏","text":"官山山下水西头，杨柳津前绿荫舟。\n海内风涛多不定，未应长啸独临流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8478,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日南昌山中游览贻诸友二首 其一","author":"何维柏","text":"城市纷纷逐岁华，不知春色满天涯。\n云深古洞无人到，开遍桃源几树花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8479,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日南昌山中游览贻诸友二首 其二","author":"何维柏","text":"二月黄鹂枝上啼，桃花流出武陵溪。\n仙源此去无多路，独自寻芳信马蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8480,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天山草堂与杨贞复论白沙先生学兼贻同会诸友四首 其一","author":"何维柏","text":"柳塘竹坞睹风轻，日午黄鹂深处鸣。\n读罢草堂无一事，尊前同对水云清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8481,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天山草堂与杨贞复论白沙先生学兼贻同会诸友四首 其二","author":"何维柏","text":"天山洞里径森森，白日青尊对绿阴。\n云影山光看不厌，几人知道洞天深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8482,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天山草堂与杨贞复论白沙先生学兼贻同会诸友四首 其三","author":"何维柏","text":"江门风月此尊前，吟弄俄经五十年。\n少壮光阴莫虚掷，好从端默契心传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8483,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天山草堂与杨贞复论白沙先生学兼贻同会诸友四首 其四","author":"何维柏","text":"杖藜随处是天台，更喜刘郎此地来。\n共访仙源莫归去，山城今有楚云台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8484,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早朝祀典","author":"何维柏","text":"千官清晓集彤墀，三殿高居映紫薇。\n鹓列森严惭补衮，龙颜渊穆正垂衣。\n明明帝德光中夏，济济贤才佐万几。\n自幸暮年叨际会，敢摅忠悃答恩辉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8485,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游南华","author":"何维柏","text":"南华路口别多时，尚逐尘劳觉已非。\n野寺苍松虚鹤梦，洞门芳草待人归。\n传灯塔里留僧偈，说法堂前有佛衣。\n日暮肩舆独乘兴，昙花琪树正依依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8486,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去妇叹赠三溪包公 其一","author":"何维柏","text":"少小崇姆仪，不解学蛾眉。\n自知粗拙性，效颦欲何为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8487,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去妇叹赠三溪包公 其二","author":"何维柏","text":"入门敬事姑，辛苦挈孩稚。\n不得娣姒意，伤哉中谗忌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8488,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去妇叹赠三溪包公 其三","author":"何维柏","text":"驱车晨出门，四顾呱呱泣。\n岂不念茕孑，去矣吾何及。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8489,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去妇叹赠三溪包公 其四","author":"何维柏","text":"吾去不足惜，眷彼后来人。\n后人鉴吾辙，谁复念酸辛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8490,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去妇叹赠三溪包公 其五","author":"何维柏","text":"直木无繁柯，安能附茑萝。\n托身苟得所，时命如吾何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8491,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去妇叹赠三溪包公 其六","author":"何维柏","text":"黯黯度寒云，皎皎淡明月。\n贞心无改移，明月有圆缺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8492,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"亭菊 其一","author":"何维柏","text":"亭亭寒菊，灼灼其英。\n芝兰和之，有美斯馨。\n松竹友之，盈于中庭。\n静言对之，实获我情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8493,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"亭菊 其二","author":"何维柏","text":"明月鉴之，如玉之屑。\n严霜厉之，如冰斯洁。\n静言对之，君子之节。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8494,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"亭菊 其三","author":"何维柏","text":"菊之华兮，皓衣黄裳。\n菊之色兮，金玉其相。\n静言晤兮，曷能其忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8495,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"亭菊 其四","author":"何维柏","text":"北风号林，万卉具凋。\n幽香玉秀，静正不恌。\n我思古人，中心迢迢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8496,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]